摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness web GUI file panel plugin: browse and edit workspace files in-browser (Monaco editor + vim/emacs keymaps).","id":"gh:1335696252","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-files-panel","slug":"JiayuuWang/dsh-files-panel","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness web GUI file panel plugin: browse and edit workspace files in-browser (Monaco edito"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"r + vim/emacs keymaps)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-files-panel"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Interactive terminal, workspace file browser, and tmux-style split panes for the DeepSeek Harness "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"web GUI (`dsh web`).**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"This plugin extends the DeepSeek Harness browser surface with three features:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Feature | What you get |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| **Terminal** | A real interactive terminal tab beside Chat/Trajectory. Per-pane PTYs with a shell "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"picker (Windows: `pwsh` / `cmd`; Linux/macOS: `bash` / `zsh` / `sh`). |\n| **File browser** | A works"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"pace file tree with per-type icons and syntax-highlighted editing (save with conflict detection, Vim"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"/Emacs keymaps, drag-resizable tree/editor split). |\n| **Split panes** | tmux-style panes: recursive"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" split right/down, per-pane fullscreen, draggable dividers, sizes that follow the window. Splitting "},{"id":"p6s6","text":"a Chat pane starts a **new session** side by side, and **each chat pane gets its own input box** siz"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"a **new session** side by side, and **each chat pane gets its own input box** sized with the pane. |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The plugin is a set of packages inside the `deepseek-harness` monorepo. It modifies core packages, s"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"o it is installed by applying the cumulative patch to a clean checkout and building with the app — t"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"hree ways, from easiest to most manual:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**1. npm (recommended)** — no need to clone this repo (package: `@jiayuw/dsh-files-panel`):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The npm package ships the patch and an installer bin: it validates the checkout, applies `patch/dsh-"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"files-panel.patch` (skipped when already applied), then runs `pnpm install` and `pnpm run build`. (`"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"--apply-only` skips the build for a dry check.)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**2. Installer scripts** from this checkout:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**3. Manually** — in a `deepseek-harness` checkout at base commit `47f943859b`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open the printed URL (default `http://127.0.0.1:3080`) and hard-refresh (`Ctrl+F5`)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Open a session → the **Terminal** tab opens a live shell; the toolbar lets you pick the shell and "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"restart it.\n- The **folder icon** in the session header opens the workspace file browser.\n- Each pan"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"e's thin toolbar has **⫞** split right, **⫟** split down, **⛶** fullscreen, **✕** close. Focus a pan"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"e, then click the top tab to switch its view (Chat / Trajectory / Terminal). A split chat pane has i"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"ts own input box; closing a pane re-flows the rest to fill the grid."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Full usage: docs/USAGE.md · docs/USAGE.zh.md（中文）"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`src/packages/` mirrors the harness monorepo paths, so each file's location tells you where it belon"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"c/packages/` mirrors the harness monorepo paths, so each file's location tells you where it belongs:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- `host/web-terminal`, `host/web-terminal-local` — terminal capability seam + local provider\n- `host"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"/workspace-files`, `host/workspace-files-fs` — workspace file seam + provider\n- `host/apiproxy/src/a"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"pi/{terminal,files}.*` + `fetch/*` — the `terminal.*` / `files.*` wire domains\n- `client/ui-terminal"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"`, `client/ui-files` — the browser Terminal and file-panel views\n- `client/ui-conversation` — the sp"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"lit-pane grid, pane store, and cross-session panes\n- `client/ui-slots`, `client/web-react`, `client/"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"runtime` — framework additions (`SessionBoundary`, `provideInfoOf`)\n- `client/tsdown.client.ts`, `bu"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ndle/web-app` — build + registration"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Terminal output is polled (~60 ms), not streamed; fixed size, `TERM=dumb` (no color / full-screen "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"programs yet).\n- A split grid shares each session's chat state across panes of that session.\n- The f"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ile tree and terminal are human-facing only; their content is not fed to the model."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
